          "text": "The pattern indexes as a **CuPt-type ordered zincblende derivative**, trigonal **R3m (No. 160)**. Alternating Al and Ga cation layers along cubic \u27e8111\u27e9 generate the low-angle superstructure reflections, especially 003 at 13.35\u00b0 and 101 at 25.72\u00b0. Refined hexagonal-cell parameters are approximately \\(a=4.0577\\) \u00c5 and \\(c=19.8815\\) \u00c5.\n\n```cif\ndata_AlGaAs2_CuPt_ordered\n_audit_creation_method              'Derived from supplied Cu Kalpha1 powder pattern'\n_chemical_name_common               'CuPt-type ordered AlGaAs2'\n_chemical_formula_structural        'AlGaAs2'\n_chemical_formula_sum               'Al3 As6 Ga3'\n_cell_formula_units_Z               3\n\n_cell_length_a                      4.0577\n_cell_length_b                      4.0577\n_cell_length_c                     19.8815\n_cell_angle_alpha                  90\n_cell_angle_beta                   90\n_cell_angle_gamma                 120\n_cell_volume                      283.50\n\n_space_group_crystal_system         trigonal\n_space_group_name_H-M_alt           'R 3 m'\n_space_group_IT_number              160\n\nloop_\n_atom_site_label\n_atom_site_type_symbol\n_atom_site_symmetry_multiplicity\n_atom_site_Wyckoff_symbol\n_atom_site_fract_x\n_atom_site_fract_y\n_atom_site_fract_z\n_atom_site_occupancy\nAl1  Al  3  a  0.000000  0.000000  0.000000  1.0\nGa1  Ga  3  a  0.000000  0.000000  0.500000  1.0\nAs1  As  3  a  0.000000  0.000000  0.125000  1.0\nAs2  As  3  a  0.000000  0.000000  0.625000  1.0\n```\n\nRepresentative indexing:\n\n| 2\u03b8 observed (\u00b0) | Reflection |\n|---:|:---|\n| 13.35 | 003, ordering reflection |\n| 25.72 | 101, ordering reflection |\n| 26.884 | 006 |\n| 31.15 | 104 |\n| 34.02 | 015 |\n| 40.84 | 107 |\n| 44.63 | 110, overlapping 018 |\n| 46.78 | 113 |\n| 52.87 | 202, overlapping 116 |\n| 64.95 | 208 |\n| 71.62 | 122 |\n| 82.24 | 300, overlapping 128 |\n| 88.45 | 306 |\n\nThe parent pseudocubic zincblende parameter is about \\(a_{\\rm pc}=5.739\\) \u00c5. The powder data cannot distinguish the opposite polar domain, obtained by replacing the As \\(z\\) coordinates with 0.375 and 0.875; it has identical non-resonant powder intensities and is not a separate structural model.",
